      "content": "hey i need some help looking into something weird. i was trying to log into my old dev forum today and it says \"user not found\" even tho i know the login is right. then i went to check my secondary email account and it's been deactivated for some reason?? i havent even used it in months. it feels like my stuff is just... disappearing. like someone is scrubbing my digital footprint. can u help me figure out if there's a pattern here or if this is just random glitching?",
