      "role": "user",
      "content": "a coordinated purge?? that's what i'm thinking. it's too specific to be just \"inactive account\" stuff. like, why would the forum and the email both go at the same time? i checked my cloud backups too and some of the folders are just... empty. just gone. like they were never even there. do you think a single entity could actually be doing this? like someone with admin-level access to the infrastructure itself?",
